{"id":2542,"date":"2023-05-14T03:07:35","date_gmt":"2023-05-14T03:07:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/son.webrt.net\/angeline\/?p=2542"},"modified":"2024-11-11T11:34:46","modified_gmt":"2024-11-11T11:34:46","slug":"trang-tri-sinh-nhat-be-trai-chu-de-bong-da","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-be-trai-chu-de-bong-da\/","title":{"rendered":"Trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 B\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 &#8211; Sinh nh\u1eadt Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng &#8211; Bun"},"content":{"rendered":"<div dir=\"auto\"><strong>Trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1<\/strong> lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c b\u00e9 trai \u01b0a th\u00edch. Trong ng\u00e0y sinh nh\u1eadt c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n ch\u01a1i b\u1ed9 m\u00f4n th\u1ec3 thao m\u00e0 m\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u00edch th\u1eadt tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi.<\/div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;\">Trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 &#8211; Sinh nh\u1eadt Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng Bun<\/span><\/strong><\/h2>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">B\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng Bun h\u00f4m nay th\u00eam m\u1ed9t tu\u1ed5i. Hoàng Lâm Decor l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng Ba M\u1eb9 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ti\u1ec7c sinh nh\u1eadt cho b\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf \u0111\u00e1ng y\u00eau n\u00e0y. Hoàng Lâm Decor r\u1ea5t vui khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Ba M\u1eb9 b\u00e9 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb <a href=\"http:\/\/angeline.vn\/category\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat\/\"><strong>t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt<\/strong> <\/a>cho con trong su\u1ed1t 8 n\u0103m qua. Hoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ee9ng ki\u1ebfn Bun thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o, t\u1eeb l\u00fac b\u1ea1n c\u00f2n l\u00e0 em b\u00e9 nh\u1ecf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3 nh\u00e0 b\u1ebf b\u1ed3ng cho \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t b\u1ea1n Bun n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9ng, tinh ngh\u1ecbch, tr\u00e0n ng\u1eadp n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. M\u1ed7i m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, m\u1ed9t giai \u0111o\u1ea1n ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n Bun l\u1ea1i c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng \u0111am m\u00ea v\u00e0 s\u1edf th\u00edch ri\u00eang. N\u0103m nay trong l\u1ea7n sinh nh\u1eadt th\u1ee9 8 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, Hoàng Lâm Decor c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi Ba M\u1eb9 \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap Bun tho\u1ea3 m\u00e3n ni\u1ec1m h\u00e2m m\u1ed9 c\u00e2u l\u1ea1c b\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 PSG c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c c\u1ea7u th\u1ee7 n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng nh\u01b0 Messi, Mbappe&#8230; qua m\u1eabu <strong>trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1<\/strong> ho\u00e0nh tr\u00e1ng n\u00e0y.<\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">M\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa, Hoàng Lâm Decor c\u1ea3m \u01a1n Ba M\u1eb9 \u0111\u00e3 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng Angeline. M\u1ed7i m\u1ed9t m\u1eabu thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb9p, \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111am m\u00ea c\u00e1 t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Bun c\u0169ng ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Hoàng Lâm Decor d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng cho b\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang ta thay l\u1eddi c\u1ea3m \u01a1n.<\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ch\u00fac Bun sang tu\u1ed5i m\u1edbi ch\u0103m ngoan h\u1ecdc gi\u1ecfi.<\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">V\u00e0 gi\u1edd Ba M\u1eb9 h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng Hoàng Lâm Decor kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 bu\u1ed5i ti\u1ec7c sinh nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng &#8211; Bun b\u00ean nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><strong>Sinh nh\u1eadt Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng &#8211; Bun 8 tu\u1ed5i<\/strong><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><strong>Concept:\u00a0<\/strong> C\u00e2u l\u1ea1c b\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 PSG<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><strong>Decor:<\/strong> Angeline<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2543 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-1202x800.jpg\" alt=\"trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1\" width=\"1020\" height=\"679\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-1202x800.jpg 1202w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-601x400.jpg 601w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1-600x399.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2544 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-1246x800.jpg\" alt=\"trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1\" width=\"1020\" height=\"655\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-1246x800.jpg 1246w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-623x400.jpg 623w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-768x493.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-1536x986.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1-600x385.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/2-1.jpg 1959w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2551 size-large\" src=\"ht