ntent\/uploads\/2023\/05\/11-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/11-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/11-600x399.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/11.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2555 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-1202x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"679\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-1202x800.jpg 1202w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-601x400.jpg 601w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13-600x399.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/13.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2558 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-1202x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"679\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-1202x800.jpg 1202w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-601x400.jpg 601w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16-600x399.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/16.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2559 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-1202x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"679\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-1202x800.jpg 1202w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-601x400.jpg 601w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy-600x399.jpg 600w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/IMG_117-copy.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" \/><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\">K\u1ebft lu\u1eadn<\/span><\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Tr\u00ean \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t <a href=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/trang-tri-sinh-nhat-be-trai-chu-de-bong-da\/\"><strong>m\u1eabu t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c sinh nh\u1eadt theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1<\/strong><\/a> m\u00e0 Hoàng Lâm Decor d\u00e0nh t\u00e2m huy\u1ebft th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n. \u0110\u1ec3 c\u00e1c b\u00e9 y\u00eau nh\u00e0 m\u00ecnh c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i sinh nh\u1eadt vui v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a. Ba M\u1eb9 h\u00e3y l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 m\u00e0 c\u00e1c b\u00e9 y\u00eau th\u00edch. \u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o lu\u00f4n s\u1eb5n sang \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng m\u1ecdi s\u1edf th\u00edch v\u00e0 mong mu\u1ed1n c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c b\u00e9.<\/p>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/p>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor &#8211; TRANG TR\u00cd TI\u1ec6C SINH NH\u1eacT, S\u1ef0 KI\u1ec6N CHUY\u00caN NGHI\u1ec6P:<\/p>\n<p><strong><em>&#8220;N\u1ee5 c\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ee7a b\u00e9 y\u00eau, s\u1ef1 h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng c\u1ee7a Ba M\u1eb9 l\u00e0 s\u1ee9 m\u1ec7nh c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i&#8221;<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Address: H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i: 46 Thanh Nh\u00e0n, Qu\u1eadn Hai B\u00e0 Tr\u01b0ng, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/li>\n<li>Hotline: 0986897655 \u2013 0976830880<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/p>\n<p>C\u1ea3m \u01a1n Qu\u00fd Kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a Angeline.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c b\u00e9 trai \u01b0a th\u00edch. Trong ng\u00e0y sinh nh\u1eadt c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n ch\u01a1i b\u1ed9 m\u00f4n th\u1ec3 thao m\u00e0 m\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u00edch th\u1eadt tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi. Trang tr\u00ed sinh nh\u1eadt ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e1 &#8211; Sinh nh\u1eadt Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng Bun B\u1ea1n nh\u1ecf Th\u00e1i H\u01b0ng [&#8230;]\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":2543,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[252],"tags":[284,285],"class_list":["post-2542","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-mau-trang-tri-sinh-nhat-be-trai","tag-trang-tri-sinh-nhat-be-trai-chu-de-bong-da","tag-to-chuc-sinh-nhat-be-trai-chu-de-bong-da"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2542","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":